			y: -1.25d
			shape: "circle"
			description: [
				"&4ITEM LOCKDOWN ACTIVATED"
				""
				"&4USER SAFETY IS GUARANTEED, POWER USER."
				""
				"&4PLEASE MARK LOCATION OF UNAUTHORIZED ITEM AND CONTACT ADMINISTRATION WITH IT."
				""
				"&4THANK YOU FOR YOUR SE...."
				""
				"&dWell quite enough of that I have to say. What an interesting book, Bandit... let's talk."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"762526C3CC998471"
