		}
		{
			title: "Exploring the Dead Worlds"
			icon: "kubejs:unlock_dimensions_clear"
			x: 0.75d
			y: -0.25d
			description: [
				"&dAlright, Bandit, I figured out what that book leads to. Or rather, where."
				""
				"&dThese books lead to the other worlds of the FOP Game Server. The dieing worlds, the corrupted worlds, the worlds they have little use for, and are just waiting for the final grinder. There's also worlds they've just plain forgotten existed, falling through the ledgers to be forgotten."
				""
				"&dBut these books? I'm not sure who wrote them, but I recognize the magic. It is simply The Art. The art to write books to go to other worlds. And these were written to visit the lost worlds."
				""
				"&dHere, if you send me 150 Silver Coins, I'll put together some of my own code magic that'll let you use the books."
				""
				"&dI warn you... after you unlock the ability, be sure to read my warnings, okay?"
			]
			dependencies: ["2CBE352D0C06A68D"]
			hide: true
			id: "16EA3F8CCC942C25"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2F94CDD945F0E4DD"
				type: "item"
				item: "calemiutils:coin_penny"
				count: 150L
				consume_items: false
			}]
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "433E2B3C9FAB5C6C"
					type: "item"
					item: "kubejs:unlock_dimensions_clear"
				}
				{
					id: "01EE445A3787F359"
					type: "choice"
					table_id: 2640422954496342337L
				}
			]
		}
		{
			icon: "mystcraft2:unlinked_book"
			x: 1.75d
			y: -0.25d
			subtitle: "Be wary, Bandit"
			description: [
				"&dBefore you touch that book, Bandit, you need to be prepared."
				""
				"&dThe Descriptive Books are books to one of the Lost Worlds of the FOP Game Server. Each world is different. Many still have treasures to find and creatures to face."
				""
				"&dBut many of these worlds are corrupted. Dieing. The air could be suffocating. Things explode. Resources may just crumble under your fingers."
				""
				"&dThe Descriptive Books, as well, are one way. The moment you use it, you leave it behind as you go to the other world. You NEED a way home, or risk being lost as you try to find a way home. Don't slide out without one, such as a Linking Book like the one I'm giving you."
				""
				"&dThese books are found unlinked. The moment you Right Click with one, you bind it to the spot you stand on. Then you can use it to return to that spot... once. It, too, does not come with you."
			]
			dependencies: ["16EA3F8CCC942C25"]
			hide: true
			id: "2A8A74A97E690434"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3F1A79A2EE288EFD"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "An Age of Warnings"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "5375103254917E7D"
				type: "item"
				item: "mystcraft2:unlinked_book"
			}]
		}
		{
