				"&2Looking to expand your world access? "
				""
				"&2The FOP Game Server has many worlds available to basic and power users! New ones are being added all the time!"
				""
				"&2And to keep things fresh, old worlds will become innaccessable at some point! Don't miss out exploring and finding new things to use and sell in these worlds!"
