		{
			title: "EXPLORER'S KIT"
			icon: "kubejs:unlock_explorer_kit"
			x: -2.25d
			y: -5.5d
			description: [
				"&2Wanting to travel around easier in the FOP Game Server? Are the daunting peaks of our majestic mountains, the deep ravines, and the vast oceans prove a bit hindering to your travels? Are you on the search for something important?"
				""
				"&2Look no further than the Explorer's Kit DLC! This DLC will unlock the ability to craft a variety of tools and items to help you on your journey across the server's beautiful lands!"
				""
				"&2THIS DLC UNLOCKS : "
